            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Medical doctors have been utilizing POCT devices at POC sites (ER, ICU, and operation rooms). Now, POCT devices are used by health care professionals in the physician's office and also for home healthcare. Home healthcare (welfare/nursing care) is a focus area of the MHLW initiative to develop healthcare in order to resolve the &quot;2025 problem&quot;. The role of POCT is important in resolving this issue.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
